    excerpt: "How to request a merge when duplicate Google Business Profiles are splitting a contractor's reviews and visibility.",
    metaDescription: "How Google Business Profile merge requests work for contractors dealing with duplicate listings that split reviews and rankings.",
    category: "Local SEO & City Guides",
    readTime: "6 min read",
